dialogue = Array[String](["[b]Nutrition Staff:[/b] Got your food? Good, that’ll be 30 dabloons.", "[b][rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Jim Jar:[/rainbow][/b] But I don't have any money…", "[b]Nutrition Staff:[/b] ( ͠° ͟ʖ ͡°)﻿", "[b][rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]Jim Jar:[/rainbow][/b] Don’t I work for you? Can’t you take it out of my paycheck?", "[b]Nutrition Staff:[/b] No. Don’t be an [b][shake rate=20.0 level=8 connected=1]IDIOT[/shake][/b]."])

