dialogue = Array[String](["[b]Mike:[/b] Hey have you seen the projections for Q2?", "[b]Janice:[/b] Yes! Golly jee, they're off the charts!", "[b]Mike:[/b] Right?! Gosh, we're so productive!", "[b]Janice:[/b] [wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=1][i]sips fluids[/i][/wave] My stars, that's good.", "[b]Mike:[/b] I know! This water really sustains me."])

